          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line2": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Studies show that the rate of survival from sudden cardiac arrest decreases by 10% every minute without intervention.<sup>1</sup> Bob Zollner, a retired firefighter, suffered a sudden cardiac arrest on his wife’s birthday. Watch how she saved his life with the help of their local fire department.</span>",
